{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_028ari_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_003_1000_p", "source_sha256": "7c73daf3386467c9b58c9fa6276f972dd0af19280f04f7123730f568d2ab4d63", "ja": "（今日はついに、亜利沙の初ステージだ）", "zh": "（今天是亚利沙首次登台表演的日子。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_028ari_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_003_1001_p", "source_sha256": "d840907958b94c6342502834dc8e33eb3d19365aca68becfa77c755b5b4a8823", "ja": "亜利沙は、もう舞台袖で待機してるはずだな。\nちょっと様子を見てこよう。", "zh": "亚利沙应该已经在舞台侧边待命了。\n去看看她的状况吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_028ari_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_003_1002_028ari", "source_sha256": "70e96f9e9ce6f07ec5e6453e71b68e26e06a734a4c0528f8f46b89c71c154bc4", "ja": "うぅ、す、スゴい熱気です……。\nステージ裏まで、お客さん達の気配が伝わって……。", "zh": "呜，好、好惊人的热度……\n连在舞台后方也能感受到观众席的氛围……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_028ari_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_003_1003_028ari", "source_sha256": "31adb5d5a1e5fb89a2a572baf854500418fc859d1ad809ce4ba6a3f938c55011", "ja": "や……\nやっぱり、やっぱりムリですよぉーっ！！", "zh": "果……\n果然、果然没办法啦──！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_028ari_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_003_1004_028ari", "source_sha256": "28b72ddd549df90d22a9ad532b5aa75d177e8597ecb427d7ba9f58e834ea286b", "ja": "ありさはステージで歌うより、\n客席でコールしてる方がお似合いなんです～！！！", "zh": "亚利沙比起在舞台上唱歌，\n还是更适合在观众席喊Call啦～！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_028ari_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_003_1005_p", "source_sha256": "cedebaf8ae8dc1c9a1acb2de49416747fb89bcf01ad3f4a79d1d5125221286bc", "ja": "あ、亜利沙！？\n待て待て、逃げ出そうとするなっ。", "zh": "亚、亚利沙！？\n等等，别想逃！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_028ari_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_003_1006_028ari", "source_sha256": "d2b4f544f04123cd9fed0d934bfeb7c5c3e49d589935e098eed8a462591293a8", "ja": "{$P$}さん、離してくださいっ！\n後生ですから、お願いします～！", "zh": "{$P$}先生，快放手！\n求求你了，拜托啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_028ari_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_003_1007_p", "source_sha256": "d44141f3fc60a089a8bf2423fdd25cfd038f136896b7526a8e880427684aa6ce", "ja": "（様子を見に来て正解だったな。\nよし、ここはひとつ……）", "zh": "（还好我有来看看。\n好，这种时候就该……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_028ari_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_003_1008", "source_sha256": "6677276f1668813e91493730d00c8d67153390a3e5d46504fc1ed6b52dd46512", "ja": "鏡の前に立たせる", "zh": "让她站在镜子前", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_028ari_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_003_2000_p", "source_sha256": "7fa3e3b8c7072786a53a9308885645ffc3a1d9e0f0ae1e8e9694bc10e2deae30", "ja": "亜利沙、落ち着け。\nいいから、この鏡を見てみろ。", "zh": "亚利沙，冷静点。\n好啦，看看这面镜子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_028ari_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_003_2001_028ari", "source_sha256": "c2e2056385f7aee3f246d7a849a0892b09263afd336563874e718f127ff075c6", "ja": "か、鏡……ですか？", "zh": "镜、镜子……吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_028ari_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_003_2002_p", "source_sha256": "7708998648fb70a092f312d2f869c98d44ee92819a8ca266ac5d175c2544d8a4", "ja": "ああ、そうだ。\nこの鏡に映ってるのは、誰だ？", "zh": "嗯，没错。\n这面镜子里的人是谁？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_028ari_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_003_2003_028ari", "source_sha256": "7a246ecd9dc6e5b2d53c95450472d1ed367c1d4d0333ebb05af16771b68f82d7", "ja": "誰って……あ、ありさですよぉ……。", "zh": "你问是谁……是、是亚利沙啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_028ari_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_003_2004_p", "source_sha256": "cfe8b4d9e440e3727fc3d0e961e92dc98006bf24db3d59b45afaa2eded1e7151", "ja": "違う。\n亜利沙だけど、亜利沙じゃない。", "zh": "不对。\n虽然是亚利沙，但不是亚利沙。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_028ari_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_003_2005_028ari", "source_sha256": "9a8da975407267ccf339673f5a85056dafd53eda3e3d55106b900a0dbd7544b8", "ja": "へ？\n{$P$}さん、何を言って……。", "zh": "咦？\n{$P$}先生，你在说什么……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_028ari_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_003_2006_p", "source_sha256": "f81b76609201f5c5354bdc49a2a58a5f3d2302210c46bc062684c8ba26e84e8f", "ja": "ここに映っているのは、今日ステージデビューする\n新人アイドルの、『松田亜利沙』だ。", "zh": "这个人是今天将在舞台上出道的\n新人偶像『松田亚利沙』。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_028ari_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_003_2007_028ari", "source_sha256": "35c3607bc7bea1b3e4d7dca1b67b0e80b250f7e4e617a7e8b0192a73ddd2dd43", "ja": "新人アイドル……松田亜利沙……。", "zh": "新人偶像……松田亚利沙……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_028ari_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_003_2008_p", "source_sha256": "8048adf12521ccbbbd8e01656b04e269b35f6b540fc61eedce451f87bc0095ab", "ja": "亜利沙は、アイドルが好きなんだよな？", "zh": "亚利沙很喜欢偶像对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_028ari_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_003_2009_p", "source_sha256": "2236b1064aaa6e986386d73e965c61c391360c50bbac964f85f6eb0ee800362e", "ja": "なら、鏡の中で不安そうな顔をしている新人\nアイドルのことを、誰よりも応援してあげないと。", "zh": "那么，对于镜子里这位看起来很不安的新人偶像，\n你更该好好支持她啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_028ari_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_003_2010_028ari", "source_sha256": "bf0b049cda0ec8ee0bdc44ec14cb74c1eeda84a8246e18c1bd5e1e0adb41b51c", "ja": "そう……そう、でした……。\n{$P$}さんの、言う通りです！", "zh": "对……对耶……\n{$P$}先生，你说得没错！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_028ari_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_003_2011_028ari", "source_sha256": "c0d39ef10aa9d7e80b3d91153520018216800df77b6e952f52273cc23a89ee49", "ja": "アイドルちゃんを応援しないなんて！\nそんなの、そんなのありさじゃありませんっ！", "zh": "怎么能不支持偶像宝贝呢！\n这样、这样不像亚利沙的作风！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_028ari_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_003_2012_p", "source_sha256": "689ed7fdef6af934d530007b9a560406750a239b89b2c5a099f1d3a398ce70bc", "ja": "（亜利沙の表情に、輝きが戻ってきた。\nこれなら……）", "zh": "（亚利沙的表情又变得闪耀了。\n这样就没问题了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_028ari_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_003_2013_028ari", "source_sha256": "dab57deec9feebeb71635bacc80145debc32bf14d4d63812cb39208c74f19105", "ja": "{$P$}さん！", "zh": "{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_028ari_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_003_2014_028ari", "source_sha256": "2cb060c7d131125c1d7c7babf9b8e719722a5becf85f7c39ff21355642eee309", "ja": "ありさは今から、『松田亜利沙』っていう\n新人アイドルちゃんを、全力で応援してきます！", "zh": "亚利沙现在要去全力地，\n替名为『松田亚利沙』的新人偶像宝贝加油打气！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_028ari_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_003_2015_028ari", "source_sha256": "0e4f0d93c66a66405387b4e9a33e4ae21697f9311e379cb2b01525c9d32a62f3", "ja": "アイドルちゃんの笑顔が、客席に届く時……\nお客さん達もまた、笑顔になるんです！", "zh": "当偶像宝贝的笑容传到观众席时……\n观众们一定也会露出笑容的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_028ari_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_003_2016_p", "source_sha256": "f2b7898ec5d3ad0ab889dba7e7a16cf556f6514360b8d5b7944bdf42eb48bbb9", "ja": "そうだな。その新人アイドルは、\n無事に笑顔を届けられそうか？", "zh": "是啊。\n那位新人偶像能顺利地带给大家笑容吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_028ari_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_003_2017_028ari", "source_sha256": "8cc1a93f50118d41f0980fc1c671c570c6ccac104415b974a62e839122cb8904", "ja": "はいっ！\nムフフ、張り切っちゃいますよ～！", "zh": "可以！\n唔呼呼，要拿出干劲啰～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_028ari_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_003_2018_p", "source_sha256": "98d5d21c428f72e4a7994cbf870d36a4cc827eaa3963e90aea24ad97940b043c", "ja": "（そう言って、亜利沙は勢いよくステージへと\n駆け出していく。写真撮影の時と同じように）", "zh": "（亚利沙这么说完，便飞快地跑上舞台。\n就像之前拍照时那样。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_028ari_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_003_2019_p", "source_sha256": "871388639a22533c525f957d417b330ca7d1ed5dd8c7c97d6b2697cd72a3b3cb", "ja": "（松田亜利沙という新人アイドルの物語は、今、\n始まった。その姿を、観客席に焼き付けてこい……！）", "zh": "（松田亚利沙这位新人偶像的故事，现在揭开序幕了。\n将你的身影烙印在观众眼底吧……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
